{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/extras/Objectives.png?t=1762190561\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break into toy stores. Steal toys. Avoid the terrors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a toy collector who takes the hobby a bit too far... by breaking into toy stores at night. Whether alone or with a crew of up to 5 other goofy robbers, you\u2019ll sneak into stores, loot them clean, and escape before employees return in the morning.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it won\u2019t be easy. The stores are heavily guarded by deadly, AI-controlled security toys programmed to protect the stores at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/extras/ToyCollections.png?t=1762190561\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From teddy bears, dolls, to plushies. Can you collect them all?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snag toys ranging from common plushies to ultra-rare collectibles. Every item you steal is added to your personal display in your warehouse.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell duplicate toys for cash to unlock new gear, cosmetics, and tools to help with future heists.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/extras/DeadlySecurities.png?t=1762190561\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The only problem? The toy stores are guarded by deadly, AI-powered security toys.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Go prepared, these things don\u2019t play around. Bring flashlights, scanners, distractions, and more to survive the night and escape with the loot.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831100?t=1762190561","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/9102815d5156dcef6c8b49f8845609db3c3f34c3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762190561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/e0a0c579a55220503638f26cb783fb8279882cc7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762190561","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/e0a0c579a55220503638f26cb783fb8279882cc7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762190561","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/extras/Objectives.png?t=1762190561\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break into toy stores. Steal toys. Avoid the terrors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a toy collector who takes the hobby a bit too far... by breaking into toy stores at night. Whether alone or with a crew of up to 5 other goofy robbers, you\u2019ll sneak into stores, loot them clean, and escape before employees return in the morning.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it won\u2019t be easy. The stores are heavily guarded by deadly, AI-controlled security toys programmed to protect the stores at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/extras/ToyCollections.png?t=1762190561\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From teddy bears, dolls, to plushies. Can you collect them all?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snag toys ranging from common plushies to ultra-rare collectibles. Every item you steal is added to your personal display in your warehouse.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell duplicate toys for cash to unlock new gear, cosmetics, and tools to help with future heists.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/extras/DeadlySecurities.png?t=1762190561\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The only problem? The toy stores are guarded by deadly, AI-powered security toys.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Go prepared, these things don\u2019t play around. Bring flashlights, scanners, distractions, and more to survive the night and escape with the loot.</p>","developers":["Chreseeba Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831100/7dcdc4d89bdf6f9a214947822f72f2f2a4fba75f/header.jpg?t=1762190561","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Toy Terribles","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or new-gen i3 / AMD equivalent<br>